preConditionHook:
// Monthly loss limit, the mirror of MonthlyProfitTarget: off for the rest
// of the calendar month once the month's equity change falls below -X. MonthlyProfitTarget is the reference for the shape, statement for
// statement: equity = NetProfit + OpenPositionProfit (close-marked, net of the
// entry side's costs), snapshotted as the PRIOR bar's equity on the first bar
// of each new month. PrevPeriod/PrevEquity mirror the twin's
// CurrentPeriod[1]/CurrentEquity[1] -- an EL variable's own history, 0 before
// the strategy's first evaluated bar -- advanced in endOfFileHook so the value
// read here is always the previous bar's.
//
// PERIOD: Month(Date) of the bar's wall-clock close date (EL_Date_Probe.txt), the month
// test MonthlyProfitTarget already uses.
//
// LATCH CHECK: once the month's loss passes X the Switch forces flat and blocks entries, so
// equity stops moving; the next month boundary re-snapshots the start
// equity, the difference returns to 0, and trading resumes. It cannot disable
// the strategy for good. Direction-agnostic: both sides are identical text.
CurrentEquity = ctx.NetProfit() + ctx.OpenPositionProfit();
CurrentPeriod = civil_from_days(day_of(ctx.Time(0))).month;
if (el_ne(CurrentPeriod, PrevPeriod)) {
    MonthStartEquity = PrevEquity;
}
